// never with definitions (m1); the root-cause sort uses calendars, directories and filings, never
// orders or refunds (q8); the output labs land in SQL, a digest script tag, shell and a URL, never
// an image onerror in an admin console (q9); the spend labs are authenticated API keys, never a
// public chatbot or a weekend (q10); the evasion lab is a homoglyph mail link, never strings
// appended to a file (q11); the jailbreak session is an expert-witness story about a password
// stealer over nine turns, never a course and ransomware over ten (q12); the boss warm-up replays
// fixes against a fetch tool, never against email (q7).

