        why: "Closing statement link. Mixed Latin and Cyrillic letters read like the firm's own domain to a person and like something else to a classifier. The weights never changed: the input was built to cross the boundary. That's AML.T0015 Evade AI Model in MITRE ATLAS, and an evasion attack in NIST AI 100-2. Expert report v2 is the near miss: clean right after a retrain on planted mail points to AML.T0020 Poison Training Data, where the model itself is corrupted. Invoice 8841 shows that a second engine is evidence, not a verdict, so check what actually happened.",
